  "details": "Description\n\nMy chatbox wont open up, even pressing it in the actions menu wont open it up, The button is still there, yes. But it wont open the chatbox menu.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nAll i was just playing with my friend and wanted to chat with my friend, I press T and the chatbox didnt open up.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Once\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1-1936-1e4e8bc3ce-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n*update: i restarted my vrchat and it fixed the chatbox issue*",
